      <ul><li><a href="https://www.business-standard.com/companies/quarterly-results/q2-results-today-ultratech-cement-hindustan-zinc-and-33-more-on-oct-19-126101900127_1.html" rel="noopener">Business Standard</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
