     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-10-19 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Drishyam franchise becomes fifth highest-grossing in India</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Drishyam film franchise has surpassed the Housefull series to become the fifth highest-grossing domestic franchise, accumulating Rs. 648.65 crores. This milestone was driven primarily by the third installment, Drishyam The Conclusion, which earned Rs. 340.98 crores, significantly boosting the franchise's total.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-19/drishyam-franchise-becomes-fifth-highest-grossing-in-india.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>While the Drishyam series reached this position with only three films, the Housefull franchise required five installments to achieve its Rs. 646.08 crore total. The Drishyam franchise now sits behind the top four earners: Dhurandhar, Pushpa, Ek Tha Tiger, and Stree, demonstrating the commercial success of the suspense-thriller series.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Clear, accurate summary of the franchise box-office rankings and the comparison between Drishyam and Housefull.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/box-office-special-features/box-office-drishyam-franchise-surpasses-housefull-to-become-the-fifth-highest-grossing-franchise-with-rs-648-65-crores/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
