      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/videos/world/india-new-zealand-fta-to-come-into-force-from-october-20-duty-free-trade-20-billion-investment-10389415.html" rel="noopener">News18 World</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
