  <nav class="catrow"><span class="catgrp"><b>News</b><a href="/category/national">national</a><a href="/category/world">world</a><a href="/category/defence">defence</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Money</b><a href="/category/business">business</a><a href="/category/finance">finance</a><a href="/category/education">education</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Sports</b><a href="/category/sports">sports</a><a href="/category/cricket">cricket</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Culture</b><a href="/category/entertainment">entertainment</a><a href="/category/positive">positive</a><a href="/category/funny">funny</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Life</b><a href="/category/science">science</a><a href="/category/environment">environment</a><a href="/category/space">space</a><a href="/category/health">health</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Tech</b><a href="/category/tech">tech</a><a href="/category/ai">ai</a></span></nav></div><div class="gtr"><span>Read in your language:</span><div id="google_translate_element"></div></div><div class="wrap"><main id="content"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">← Front page</a> · <a href="/archive">Archive</a> · <a href="/category/education">education</a></p>
     <article class="story single" data-beat="education">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">EDUCATION</span> · Education (aggregate) · 2026-10-19 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Indian Coast Guard Recruitment for 365 Posts Nears Deadline</h1>
       
       <p>The Indian Coast Guard's recruitment drive for 2026 is approaching its registration deadline. Interested candidates should note the imminent closing date for applications.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-19/indian-coast-guard-recruitment-for-365-posts-nears-deadline.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>This recruitment initiative aims to fill a total of 365 posts within the Indian Coast Guard, offering a significant opportunity for job seekers.</p><p>Applicants must complete their registration by October 21, as the window for submissions will close on this date. No information regarding eligibility criteria or official links was provided in the summary.</p><p>What to watch: The Indian Coast Guard recruitment deadline is October 21.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Faithfully captures all facts from the short source summary without inventing extra details.</p>
