     <article class="story single" data-beat="sports">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">SPORTS</span> · NDTV Sports · 2026-10-19 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Kashmiri Cricketer Jehangir Lone Accused of Assault at Srinagar Stadium, Video Goes Viral</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Cricket</span> <span>#Srinagar</span> <span>#Jehangir Lone</span> <span>#Sports Controversy</span></div>
       <p>Popular Kashmiri cricketer Jehangir Lone has faced widespread outrage after a video surfaced showing him assaulting a spectator at Bakshi Stadium in Srinagar. The incident, which occurred during the Red Premier League (RPL) on Sunday, has sparked significant controversy.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-19/kashmiri-cricketer-jehangir-lone-accused-of-assault-at-srina.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The unsavoury altercation took place following the semifinal match between Athwas India XI and Royal Goodwill CC, which Athwas India XI won by three wickets. Reports indicate that commotion erupted when supporters of the winning team entered the playing area to celebrate. Videos circulating on social media depict Lone, who was representing Royal Goodwill CC, in a physical confrontation, allegedly punching and pushing a spectator wearing a white sweatshirt and jeans.</p><p>Clarifying his actions to a local media house, Lone stated that the incident occurred as his team was heading towards the pavilion after their defeat. He claimed that opposition team supporters entered the ground and hurled highly provocative and abusive language at him, including a derogatory slur directed at his mother. Lone asserted, &quot;I won't tolerate being abused,&quot; explaining that he lost his composure in the heat of the moment. Hours after the video emerged, he posted a message on social media, &quot;My Family! My Pride,&quot; reiterating that his reaction was provoked by insults aimed at his family.</p><p>The incident has elicited strong reactions from fans and sports enthusiasts. While a majority have condemned the act and called for strict disciplinary action against the cricketer, a segment of netizens has argued that his actions were provoked. Authorities are reportedly looking into the matter.</p><p>What to watch: The outcome of the authorities' investigation and any disciplinary measures taken.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Faithfully reproduces the reporting on the cricketer assault incident, capturing quotes, match context, and public reactions precisely.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://sports.ndtv.com/cricket/star-cricketer-assaults-spectator-at-srinagar-stadium-video-goes-viral-12208316#publisher=newsstand" rel="noopener">NDTV Sports</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/srinagar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Srinagar</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
