      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/laal-hit-janta-party-new-outfit-emerges-to-counter-cjps-protests-against-cec-gyanesh-kumar/articleshow/135040038.cms" rel="noopener">Times of India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
